        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 9382,
        "area_px": 96672,
        "density": 0.09705,
        "chars": 92,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 9.81
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        181,
        1104,
        1487,
        1218
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, notwithstanding substantial efforts by the City to combat housing\ndiscrimination, the residents of New York City still encounter barriers which limit equal\naccess to housing; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2292,
          "min": -1.261
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 34,
          "mean": -0.0068,
          "min": -0.2285
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 19218,
        "area_px": 146510,
        "density": 0.13117,
        "chars": 187,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 9.73
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        181,
        1258,
        1487,
        1331
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the Federal Fair Housing Act and State and City human rights\nlaws prohibit housing discrimination; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2032,
          "min": -1.0492
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0011
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 11878,
        "area_px": 93002,
        "density": 0.12772,
        "chars": 111,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 9.35
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        181,
        1373,
        1487,
        1518
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, equal housing opportunity cannot be realized until the principles\nof fair housing are fully accepted by the real estate and building industries, appraisal forms,\nfinancial institutions, property owners' associations, local government officials, and citizens;\nand",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1916,
          "min": -1.112
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 48,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0087
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 27297,
        "area_px": 184730,
        "density": 0.14777,
        "chars": 271,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 9.93
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        181,
        1565,
        1489,
        1679
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, in order to bring together all of the diverse segments of the City\nto prevent housing discrimination, it is necessary to create an advisory board to promote fair\nhousing;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2249,
          "min": -1.2095
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 37,
          "mean": -0.0009,
          "min": -0.0269
